{
  "version": 1,
  "courseId": 1362070,
  "sourceLanguage": "en",
  "targetLanguage": "zh-TW",
  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39659754",
      "title": "Working with Multiple JSX Slots",
      "sourceHash": "33a21c7d7847d2766ef24c20df9215dd2f64779c6f910724c985d86d975ee306",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.63,
          "end": 2.85,
          "en": "Now this section component here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.85,
          "end": 6.33,
          "en": "was the first additional component I wanted to add",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.33,
          "end": 11.33,
          "en": "to this project to show you this props forwarding pattern.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 11.52,
          "end": 14.31,
          "en": "Another component we could add here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.31,
          "end": 17.16,
          "en": "would be a special tabs component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.16,
          "end": 21.03,
          "en": "that manages this overall tabs area here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.03,
          "end": 24.87,
          "en": "Because if we take a closer look at our tabs system,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 24.87,
          "end": 27.87,
          "en": "we can see that our tabs are basically a combination",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.87,
          "end": 30.97,
          "en": "of having a menu bar with tab buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 32.04,
          "end": 36.03,
          "en": "and then the tab content below that menu bar.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 36.03,
          "end": 38.07,
          "en": "And that content could of course also be",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 38.07,
          "end": 39.39,
          "en": "inside of some div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.39,
          "end": 42.51,
          "en": "or some other HTML element if needed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.51,
          "end": 47.19,
          "en": "or just be below that menu bar like this as it currently is.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 47.19,
          "end": 50.28,
          "en": "Now again, there's nothing wrong with this setup,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 50.28,
          "end": 53.7,
          "en": "especially for this basic demo app we got here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 53.7,
          "end": 58.38,
          "en": "But in bigger apps, it would not be unreasonable to assume",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 58.38,
          "end": 60.75,
          "en": "that we might have different places",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 60.75,
          "end": 65.43,
          "en": "in the app where tabs like this might be used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 65.43,
          "end": 69.48,
          "en": "and therefore we might wanna have a reusable tabs component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 69.48,
          "end": 72.21000000000001,
          "en": "Hence, again here we can add a new file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 72.21000000000001,
          "end": 74.583,
          "en": "tabs.JSX, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 75.87,
          "end": 80.463,
          "en": "and then in there export a default function called tabs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 82.56,
          "end": 86.91,
          "en": "And here I then wanna return a fragment",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 86.91,
          "end": 91.68,
          "en": "where I have a menu element, so the built-in menu element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 91.68,
          "end": 93.78,
          "en": "which will wrap my buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 93.78,
          "end": 96.87,
          "en": "And below that, the actual content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 96.87,
          "end": 98.628,
          "en": "that should change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 98.628,
          "end": 100.893,
          "en": "whenever a different tap button is selected.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 102.84,
          "end": 105.09,
          "en": "So this will be another wrapper component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 105.09,
          "end": 109.65,
          "en": "in the end that just enforces a certain JSX sent,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 109.65,
          "end": 112.953,
          "en": "therefore ultimately HTML structure.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 114.18,
          "end": 117.12,
          "en": "So here of course, we can use prop destructuring",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 117.12,
          "end": 119.19,
          "en": "to for example get our children,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 119.19,
          "end": 121.11,
          "en": "this special children prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 121.11,
          "end": 123.06,
          "en": "to set the actual content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 123.06,
          "end": 125.763,
          "en": "that will be shown below our buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 126.96,
          "end": 130.5,
          "en": "So now back here in examples, JSX, we could try",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 130.5,
          "end": 133.023,
          "en": "to use this tabs component here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 133.86,
          "end": 137.91,
          "en": "And for that of course, we also must add this import",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 137.91,
          "end": 141.183,
          "en": "where we import tabs from tabs.JSX.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 143.46,
          "end": 147.51,
          "en": "And then here we can take our tab content,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 147.51,
          "end": 150.75,
          "en": "which is managed here in this examples component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 150.75,
          "end": 152.82,
          "en": "and which I wanna manage here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 152.82,
          "end": 155.43,
          "en": "not inside of the tabs component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 155.43,
          "end": 157.62,
          "en": "because the idea behind this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 157.62,
          "end": 161.07,
          "en": "is that we could use it for all kinds of tabs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 161.07,
          "end": 165.69,
          "en": "with all kinds of content in different places of the app.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 165.69,
          "end": 168.32999999999998,
          "en": "So I don't wanna manage the content in here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 168.32999999999998,
          "end": 170.82,
          "en": "it should instead be managed in the place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 170.82,
          "end": 173.28,
          "en": "where the tabs component is used.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 173.28,
          "end": 176.07,
          "en": "And therefore here in the examples component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 176.07,
          "end": 180.66,
          "en": "we can select and grab this dynamic tab content",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 180.66,
          "end": 183.513,
          "en": "and put that between our tabs here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 185.43,
          "end": 189.09,
          "en": "But of course now I also wanna get those tab buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 189.09,
          "end": 191.91,
          "en": "into my tabs component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 191.91,
          "end": 193.725,
          "en": "Now of course we could cut them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 193.725,
          "end": 196.11,
          "en": "and add them here in the menu",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 196.11,
          "end": 201.11,
          "en": "but now we have the problem that I want to handle the clicks",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 201.15,
          "end": 203.1,
          "en": "on those tab buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 203.1,
          "end": 207.27,
          "en": "in the component where I'm using it and also is selected",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 207.27,
          "end": 210.24,
          "en": "depends on data from the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 210.24,
          "end": 214.65,
          "en": "where I'm managing the overall tab related state.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 214.65,
          "end": 216.72,
          "en": "And I don't have that state here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 216.72,
          "end": 219.84,
          "en": "in this tabs component because as I just mentioned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 219.84,
          "end": 223.89,
          "en": "this should be a relatively dump wrapper component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 223.89,
          "end": 228.48,
          "en": "which doesn't know anything about the content it's managing.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 228.48,
          "end": 233.07,
          "en": "So moving the tap buttons into this tabs component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 233.07,
          "end": 236.46,
          "en": "kind of adds some extra difficulties.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 236.46,
          "end": 239.85,
          "en": "I now would have to accept some extra props here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 239.85,
          "end": 242.58,
          "en": "where I get the selected topic.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 242.58,
          "end": 247.11,
          "en": "And then also some unselect tab prop, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 247.11,
          "end": 250.47,
          "en": "which is triggered whenever some tab button is clicked.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 250.47,
          "end": 252.24,
          "en": "But adding these extra props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 252.24,
          "end": 254.88,
          "en": "does not just add some extra complexity here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 254.88,
          "end": 257.55,
          "en": "but also makes tabs less reusable",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 257.55,
          "end": 259.62,
          "en": "because now I couldn't use the component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 259.62,
          "end": 262.62,
          "en": "in a place where I'm not managing topics",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 262.62,
          "end": 265.23,
          "en": "but something totally different.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 265.23,
          "end": 267.9,
          "en": "So this is not a great solution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 267.9,
          "end": 270.57,
          "en": "I don't wanna accept a bunch of props here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 270.57,
          "end": 273,
          "en": "just to make these buttons work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 273,
          "end": 274.92,
          "en": "Instead, what would be better",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 274.92,
          "end": 277.23,
          "en": "would be to leave those buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 277.23,
          "end": 282.23,
          "en": "here in the examples JSX file, but to pass them as JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 282.72,
          "end": 286.05,
          "en": "to the tabs element just as we're passing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 286.05,
          "end": 288.303,
          "en": "this dynamic content to tabs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 289.35,
          "end": 292.38,
          "en": "The problem here just is that we only have",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 292.38,
          "end": 294.18,
          "en": "one special children prop,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 294.18,
          "end": 296.76,
          "en": "and we're using that for the content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 296.76,
          "end": 300.93,
          "en": "But now I need some additional prop here to get my buttons,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 300.93,
          "end": 304.98,
          "en": "which should be inserted between those menu tags.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 304.98,
          "end": 309.84,
          "en": "So we wanna have an additional slot for JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 309.84,
          "end": 312.123,
          "en": "in this tabs component you could say.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 313.53,
          "end": 316.92,
          "en": "And for that, we could simply add an additional prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 316.92,
          "end": 321.15,
          "en": "with any name of our choice, for example, buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 321.15,
          "end": 324.483,
          "en": "and then simply output our buttons like this here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 326.43,
          "end": 328.89,
          "en": "And then in examples JSX,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 328.89,
          "end": 331.53,
          "en": "where I'm using this tabs component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 331.53,
          "end": 336.12,
          "en": "we can set this buttons prop, but now we're not setting it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 336.12,
          "end": 340.71,
          "en": "to some string or to some number or anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 340.71,
          "end": 344.76,
          "en": "like that, but instead to some JSX code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 344.76,
          "end": 347.82,
          "en": "And that is something you can do in React",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 347.82,
          "end": 352.623,
          "en": "because as I mentioned before in this course, JSX code,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 353.621,
          "end": 357.19,
          "en": "JSX elements are in the end just regular values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 358.157,
          "end": 360.48,
          "en": "that can be used like values in your code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 360.48,
          "end": 363.12,
          "en": "So here we can grab all those tab buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 363.12,
          "end": 367.953,
          "en": "and cut them and use them as a value here for buttons.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 368.88,
          "end": 371.73,
          "en": "The only problem we'll have with that here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 371.73,
          "end": 375.81,
          "en": "is that now we got a bunch of sibling elements being used",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 375.81,
          "end": 380.81,
          "en": "as a value here, and that's simply not allowed with JSX.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 381.15,
          "end": 385.23,
          "en": "As you learned before, whenever you are using JSX code",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 385.23,
          "end": 388.037,
          "en": "as a value in some place, no matter if that place",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 388.037,
          "end": 392.22,
          "en": "is the value being returned in a component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 392.22,
          "end": 395.28,
          "en": "or a value being stored in a variable,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 395.28,
          "end": 399.65999999999997,
          "en": "you have to make sure that there's only one root element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 399.65999999999997,
          "end": 400.89300000000003,
          "en": "in that place.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 401.88,
          "end": 403.77,
          "en": "And for that, we could add a div",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 403.77,
          "end": 408.027,
          "en": "as a wrapper around these tap buttons like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 413.4,
          "end": 416.04,
          "en": "Or since we don't really need a div here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 416.04,
          "end": 419.343,
          "en": "simply this special fragment about what you learned.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 421.41,
          "end": 424.2,
          "en": "And with that, we're now setting these buttons",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 424.2,
          "end": 426.93,
          "en": "as a special prop, which might look weird",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 426.93,
          "end": 429.57,
          "en": "but which is a common pattern indeed",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 429.57,
          "end": 432.24,
          "en": "because now with that pattern being used,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 432.24,
          "end": 436.86,
          "en": "we're able to basically set two different slots",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 436.86,
          "end": 440.55,
          "en": "on this tabs component, the main content slot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 440.55,
          "end": 442.59,
          "en": "which is set with help of children.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 442.59,
          "end": 444.48,
          "en": "And then this buttons slot,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 444.48,
          "end": 448.65,
          "en": "which is set with help of our custom buttons prop.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 448.65,
          "end": 450.75,
          "en": "And of course, we could accept more props",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 450.75,
          "end": 455.7,
          "en": "and set more slots if our component would need extra slots",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 455.7,
          "end": 459.033,
          "en": "for extra JSX content that should be set.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 460.2,
          "end": 463.08,
          "en": "But here I only want to have my buttons and my children",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 463.08,
